      "content": "For a reversible reaction <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.818ex\" height=\"1.652ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 3013.6 730\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1027.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"21CC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-21CC\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2305.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"35.356ex\" height=\"2.865ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -948 15627.5 1266.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(783,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">forward reaction</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8732,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(9787.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(10787.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"4A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4A\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(12429.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use><use data-c=\"6F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6F\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1333,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(2244,477.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The activation energy of the uncatalysed forward reaction is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.343ex\" height=\"2.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -948 6339.7 1148\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"4A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4A\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3142,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use><use data-c=\"6F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6F\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1333,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(2244,477.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. When the reaction is catalysed keeping the reactant concentration same, the rate of the catalysed forward reaction at <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.884ex\" height=\"1.672ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -717 2158.6 739\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,403.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1436.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is found to be same as that of the uncatalysed reaction at <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.015ex\" height=\"1.672ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -717 2658.6 739\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1533,403.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2218\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2218\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1936.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.<br><br> The activation energy of the catalysed backward reaction is ___________ <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.592ex\" height=\"2.471ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -892 4239.7 1092\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6B\"></use><use data-c=\"4A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4A\" transform=\"translate(528,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(1042,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1642,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\"></use><use data-c=\"6F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6F\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1333,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1644,421.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.",
